#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x0b32fa
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "重试"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x0bc73e
msgid "Join the game you were invited to?"
msgstr "要加入受邀的游戏吗？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x0d9f69
msgid "If you start playing now, your game data will not be saved. Do you want to begin playing?"
msgstr "现在开始游戏，存档将不会保存。要开始吗？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x11e974
msgid "Unable to load saved data. Try again?"
msgstr "无法读取存档。重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x185ec9 olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x185ec9
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x19875a
msgid "Load completed."
msgstr "读取完成。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x348ed6
msgid "The storage device has been removed. You will need to select a storage device in order to create saved data. Connect a useable storage device and try again?"
msgstr "存储设备已移除。需选择存储设备才能创建存档。请连接可用存储设备后重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x350f34
msgid ""
"The selected storage device already contains saved data. If you select a new game, your existing game data will be deleted.\n"
"Start a new game?"
msgstr "所选存储设备已有存档。选择新游戏将删除现有存档。\n开始新游戏？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x3f129b
msgid ""
"This game possesses an auto-save feature.\n"
"Do not turn the console off while data is being saved."
msgstr "本游戏有自动保存功能。\n保存时请勿关闭主机。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x422618 olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x422618
msgid "Configuring game data."
msgstr "配置游戏数据中。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x468f9a
msgid "Select storage device"
msgstr "选择存储设备"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x4af71f olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x4af71f
msgid "Continue without saving progress"
msgstr "不保存进度继续"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x5a12d1
msgid "You do not have the type of saved data that allows you to play online. Before you can play online, you must have saved data from a game in which you cleared the opening mission. You will now start a standard game."
msgstr "你没有可联机的存档。需有通关序章任务的存档才能联机。现在将开始普通游戏。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x5ba6f0
msgid "Cannot play online without loading save data. Try again?"
msgstr "未读取存档无法联机。重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x66f18e olang/0072f326/0xdbd1b3/0x62a9e3
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x35b782/0xece603 olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x66f18e
#: olang/009c9ea4/0xdbd1b3/0x62a9e3 olang/00c6a046/0x35b782/0xece603
msgid "Unable to save game data. Try again?"
msgstr "无法保存游戏数据。重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x67152e
msgid "Your console is not connected to a useable storage device.  You will need to select a storage device in order to save game progress.  Do you want to select one now?"
msgstr "主机未连接可用存储设备。需选择存储设备才能保存进度。现在选择？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x6f6d2e
msgid "Save data cannot be found. Save data with online play enabled is needed to play online. You cannot receive the invite."
msgstr "未找到存档。联机需启用联机的存档。无法接收邀请。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x71044e olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x71044e
msgid "MGS PEACE WALKER HD"
msgstr "MGS 和平行者 HD"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x77c49d olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x77c49d
msgid "Create saved data"
msgstr "创建存档"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x78c7a5
msgid "Continue without loading"
msgstr "不读取继续"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x802a26 olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0x802a26
msgid ""
"Game data has been corrupted.\n"
"Delete existing data and create new system data?"
msgstr "游戏数据已损坏。\n删除现有数据并创建新系统数据？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x81acfe
msgid ""
"Your saved data has been corrupted.\n"
"Unable to load saved data."
msgstr "存档已损坏。\n无法读取存档。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x872e48
msgid "You will now start a standard game without joining the game you were invited to."
msgstr "现在将不加入受邀游戏，开始普通游戏。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0x9fcd91
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "登录"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xafe32f
msgid "No saved data was found in the selected storage device. Do you want to create new saved data?"
msgstr "所选存储设备中未找到存档。要创建新存档吗？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xb04128
msgid "Unable to create saved data due to insufficient available memory in the selected storage device. To create saved data, you need to have at least [lack_strage_save_capacity] KB of free space available. Connect a storage device with sufficient available memory and try again?"
msgstr "所选存储设备空间不足，无法创建存档。创建存档至少需要 [lack_strage_save_capacity] KB 可用空间。请连接空间充足的存储设备后重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xb081ab
msgid "The storage device has been removed. You will need to select a storage device in order to load saved data. Try again?"
msgstr "存储设备已移除。需选择存储设备才能读取存档。重试？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xb0c19d olang/009c9ea4/0xa49217/0xb0c19d
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xbdeecf
msgid "Save data could not be found. You cannot play online without first loading save data."
msgstr "未找到存档。不读取存档无法进行在线游戏。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xc436da
msgid "Unable to create game data due to insufficient available memory in the selected storage device. To create game data, you need to have at least [lack_strage_system_capacity] KB of free space available. Connect a storage device with the necessary free space and try again?"
msgstr "所选存储设备空间不足，无法创建游戏数据。需要至少 [lack_strage_system_capacity] KB 可用空间。请连接空间足够的存储设备后重试。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xdf5ad6
msgid "You will need to select a storage device in order to save game data. Select a storage device?"
msgstr "保存游戏数据需要选择存储设备。是否选择？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xe53e6d
msgid "Loading saved data. Do not turn off the console or remove the storage device."
msgstr "正在读取存档。请勿关闭主机或拔出存储设备。"

#: olang/0072f326/0xa49217/0xe67360
msgid "You are not signed into your gamer profile.  In order to save progress, you will need to be signed in. Do you want to sign in now?"
msgstr "你尚未登录玩家档案。要保存进度需先登录。是否现在登录？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xdbd1b3/0x79ab74
msgid "The selected storage device already contains METAL GEAR SOLID PEACE WALKER HD EDITION system data. Do you want to overwrite this data?"
msgstr "所选存储设备已有 METAL GEAR SOLID PEACE WALKER HD EDITION 系统数据。是否覆盖？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xdbd1b3/0x8d4014
msgid "The selected storage device already contains METAL GEAR SOLID PEACE WALKER HD EDITION saved data. Do you want to overwrite this data?"
msgstr "所选存储设备已有 METAL GEAR SOLID PEACE WALKER HD EDITION 存档。是否覆盖？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xdbd1b3/0xba9d90
msgid "Your console is not connected to a useable storage device. Do you want to select one now?"
msgstr "主机未连接可用存储设备。是否现在选择？"

#: olang/0072f326/0xdbd1b3/0xfbb2f1
msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "覆盖"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000133
msgid "A weekly pulp magazine filled to the brim with outlandish and absurd sci-fi/horror stories.  Roughly half of the stories are about men fighting Martians and are written by amateurs.  Not to be taken too seriously.  Lurid and sexually suggestive themes are a given.\n"
msgstr "满是离奇荒诞科幻恐怖故事的周刊廉价杂志。约半数是业余作者写的火星人战斗故事。不必太当真。低俗与性暗示内容自然少不了。\n"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000134 olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000134
msgid "A monthly pulp magazine that features mature content aimed at literary types. The real-life travel logs submitted by soldiers from around the world are a must read.  Also boasts an ample supply of scantily-clad pin-ups."
msgstr "面向文学爱好者的成人向月刊廉价杂志。士兵们从世界各地寄来的真实旅行日志值得一读。也有大量衣着暴露的写真。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000135
msgid "A quarterly men's lifestyle magazine aimed at discriminating adults. Features include articles on news, politics, and special interests such as the ever-popular \"bonsai\" corner.  Naturally, it also features its fare share of \"adult content.\""
msgstr "面向有品位成年人的季刊男性生活杂志。内容包括新闻、政治，以及备受欢迎的“盆栽”专栏等。当然也少不了“成人内容”。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000054
msgid ""
"Jigsaw made of steel wire. \n"
"Alternate pressing <I=SAW_L> and <I=SAW_R> to use."
msgstr "钢丝拼图。\n交替按 <I=SAW_L> 和 <I=SAW_R> 使用。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000081
msgid ""
"Shield made from bulletproof material. \n"
"Press <I=AIM> to use. \n"
"The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾。\n按 <I=AIM> 使用。\n防护方向随装备武器变化。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000086 olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000086
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material (colored). Press the Aim Button to use. The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的彩色盾。按瞄准键使用。防护方向随装备武器变化。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x0001af
msgid "Original t-shirt design. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues. "
msgstr "原创T恤设计。基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000000
msgid "Next we'll work on your movement."
msgstr "接下来练习移动。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000001 olang/009c9ea4/0x62c97d/0x000001
msgid "Use <I=MOVE> to move around."
msgstr "用 <I=MOVE> 移动。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000002
msgid "Use <I=WALK> to walk slowly."
msgstr "用 <I=WALK> 慢步走。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000003
msgid ""
"Decide which to use \n"
"based on your situation."
msgstr "根据情况\n灵活选用。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000004
msgid ""
"Remember that your footsteps are louder\n"
"when running, making you easier to discover."
msgstr "记住，跑步时脚步声更大，\n更容易被发现。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000005
msgid "Be careful!"
msgstr "小心！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765d1/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x62cb7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, you can use \n"
"<I=MOVE> to move!"
msgstr "BOSS，按 <I=MOVE> \n就能移动！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x076bed/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x62997d/0x000000
msgid ""
"To move your line of sight, \n"
"use <I=CAMERA>."
msgstr "要移动视线，\n用 <I=CAMERA>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x076bed/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now, when I give you an order, \n"
"look in that direction."
msgstr "我下令时，\n就朝那个方向看。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x076de5/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, let’s try up and down with\n"
"<I=CAMERA> one more time."
msgstr "好，再用<I=CAMERA>试一次\n上下。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x076ded/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, let’s try left and right with\n"
"<I=CAMERA> one more time."
msgstr "好，再用<I=CAMERA>试一次\n左右。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077dd9/0x000000
msgid "To do this,"
msgstr "为此，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077dd9/0x000001 olang/009c9ea4/0x644bfd/0x000001
msgid "position yourself near your opponent"
msgstr "先靠近对手"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077dd9/0x000002
msgid ""
"and press <I=ATK> \n"
"while you press <I=MOVE>."
msgstr "然后按住<I=MOVE>时\n按<I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077dd9/0x000003 olang/009c9ea4/0x644bfd/0x000003
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Be sure to press <I=ATK> \n"
"when the icon appears."
msgstr "图标出现时\n一定要按<I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077dd9/0x000004
msgid ""
"Now, wait for my command \n"
"and throw your opponent."
msgstr "现在等我的指令，\n把对手摔出去。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077ea9/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x6458fd/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6458fe/0x000000
msgid "Boss,"
msgstr "BOSS，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077ea9/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press <I=ATK> \n"
"as you press <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "按住<I=MOVE>时\n要按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077fd1/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x646b7d/0x000000
msgid "To throw an enemy to the ground,"
msgstr "要把敌人摔到地上，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x077fd1/0x000001
msgid "press <I=MOVE> when you have them restrained."
msgstr "制住对方后按<I=MOVE>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0782c1/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"First restrain an opponent by pressing \n"
"<I=ATK> near them."
msgstr "先靠近对手按<I=ATK>\n将其制住。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0782c1/0x000001
msgid "Then press <I=MOVE> to throw them."
msgstr "然后按<I=MOVE>摔出。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0782c1/0x000002
msgid "By pressing <I=MOVE> toward other enemies,"
msgstr "朝其他敌人方向按<I=MOVE>，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0782c1/0x000003
msgid ""
"you can send your captive flying \n"
"straight into them! "
msgstr "就能把抓住的敌人\n直接砸向他们！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0782c1/0x000004
msgid ""
"On my command, \n"
"restrain and then throw your opponent. "
msgstr "听我指令，\n制住对手再摔出去。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x078399/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press <I=MOVE> while restraining \n"
"the opponent, Boss!"
msgstr "按住对手时按 <I=MOVE>，老大！\n对手，老大！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0864ad/0x00004e
msgid "On the battlefield, showers are few and far between. And on that important mission, body odor can be a distraction not only to yourself, but to your brothers in arms. That's where this body fragrance comes in, providing a mild aroma that relaxes both body and soul, allowing you and your comrades to focus on the mission at hand."
msgstr "战场上洗澡机会少之又少。执行重要任务时，体味不仅会让自己分心，也会影响战友。这款香体露气味清淡，能放松身心，让你和同伴专心执行眼前的任务。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x101ab9/0x1f530a
msgid "Remember whether the camera is in First Person View when the L1 button is released."
msgstr "记住松开L1键时镜头是否处于第一人称视角。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x1331ad/0xae7f04
msgid "COMRADE'S ALLIES"
msgstr "战友的盟友"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x1331ad/0xb8a0c0
msgid "COMRADES"
msgstr "战友"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x1331ad/0xbbc0e2
msgid "Please verify the Date & Time settings on your device. Incorrect date settings may interfere with package deliveries."
msgstr "请检查设备的日期与时间设置。日期设置错误可能影响包裹送达。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x1766a9/0x000000 olang/009c9ea4/0x62d8fd/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d8fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, roll by pressing <I=STANCE>\n"
"while running with <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "BOSS，用<I=MOVE>奔跑时\n按<I=STANCE>翻滚！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x17ba49/0x8f9a09
msgid "Select where to attach custom parts."
msgstr "选择自定义部件位置。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x19f879/0x8f3a58
msgid ""
"VERSUS OPS is a competitive game mode that allows\n"
"up to 6 players to engage in battle against each other.\n"
"\n"
"There are 4 game types (rules) available:\n"
"\n"
" DEATH MATCH\n"
" TEAM DEATH MATCH\n"
" CAPTURE MISSION\n"
" BASE MISSION\n"
"\n"
"--------\n"
"\n"
"Please note that VERSUS OPS play may differ from\n"
"MAIN OPS in the following ways:\n"
"\n"
" - Weapon and equipment power and effects may vary.\n"
" - CO-OP Ring radius and effects may vary.\n"
" - Camaraderie and Heroism effects may vary.\n"
" - Certain staff skills may have no effect.\n"
" - Certain weapons may be prohibited.\n"
" - Certain types of equipment may be prohibited.\n"
" - CO-OPS COMM. effects may vary.\n"
" - LIFE and PSYCHE do not recover,\n"
"    even if you stay still.\n"
"\n"
"--------\n"
"\n"
"CPR\n"
"\n"
"As with other OPS, VERSUS OPS allow you to use\n"
"CPR to revive teammates that are near death, but\n"
"there are some important differences, which are\n"
"noted below:\n"
"\n"
" - The number of chest compressions necessary\n"
"    for revival differs.\n"
" - Teammates die if they are not revived within\n"
"    10 seconds.\n"
" - If you want to get back into the action quickly and\n"
"    can't wait for a teammate to revive you,\n"
"     tap <I=ACT> repeatedly to shorten the time."
msgstr "VERSUS OPS是一种竞技游戏模式，最多允许\n6名玩家相互交战。\n\n有4种游戏类型（规则）可供选择：\n\n 死亡竞赛\n 团队死亡竞赛\n 夺取任务\n 基地任务\n\n--------\n\n请注意，VERSUS OPS的玩法可能在以下方面\n与MAIN OPS不同：\n\n - 武器和装备的威力及效果可能不同。\n - CO-OP Ring的半径和效果可能不同。\n - Camaraderie和Heroism的效果可能不同。\n - 某些员工技能可能无效。\n - 某些武器可能被禁用。\n - 某些类型的装备可能被禁用。\n - CO-OPS COMM.的效果可能不同。\n - LIFE和PSYCHE不会恢复，\n    即使你保持静止。\n\n--------\n\nCPR\n\n与其他OPS一样，VERSUS OPS允许你使用\nCPR来复活濒死的队友，但\n有一些重要区别，具体\n如下：\n\n - 复活所需的胸外按压次数\n    不同。\n - 如果队友在10秒内未被复活，\n    他们就会死亡。\n - 如果你想快速重返战斗，\n    等不及队友来复活你，\n     反复点击<I=ACT>可缩短时间。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x19f879/0x92ac58
msgid "Connect with and battle other players. 2 teams of up to 3 players are allowed."
msgstr "与其他玩家连接并对战。最多可组成2队，每队3人。"

