#: olang/009c9ea4/0x215635/0x3b1b1f
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Shoot down enemy missiles<C=R> launched at the MSF Mother Base. \n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing Mother Base to be hit by 10 missiles will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"Chaff Grenades are not allowed.\n"
" # of Targets: 30"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>击落<C=R>射向MSF母基地的敌方导弹。\n<C=FF4040>母基地被10枚导弹击中即任务失败<C=R>。\n不可使用干扰弹。\n 目标数：30"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x215635/0x55aca6
msgid ""
"Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base. Find him and bring him back.\n"
" Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫已从母基地逃走。找到他并带回来。\n 所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x215635/0x75aca6
msgid ""
"Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base once again. Find him and bring him back.\n"
" Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并带回来。\n所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x215635/0x75aca9
msgid ""
"You guessed it - Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base again. Find him and bring him back.\n"
" Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>"
msgstr "你猜对了——扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并带回来。\n所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x215635/0x95aca6
msgid ""
